<article lang="<%= view.language %>" class="investor-report executive-report" data-investor-report="plan">
<% const t = view.t; const asset = report.asset; const plan = report.plan; const accounting = plan.accounting; const amount = value => value === null ? t("Not available") : formatIdr(value); %>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-snapshot">
<%- include('../partials/admin/report-header.ejs',{reportTitle:'12-MONTH PLAN + PROSPECTIVE'}) %>
<p class="report-section-label"><%= t("01 / Executive Snapshot") %></p><h3><%= t("Current position, before projections") %></h3>
<p class="report-intro"><%= t("Recorded assets show what LOKKA owns today. Revenue comes from completed sales; cash reflects recorded transactions. Inventory offers future sales opportunities, while gaps in historical records limit profit assessment and financial forecasts.") %></p>
<dl class="report-kpis">
<div class="report-kpi report-kpi--lead"><dt><%= t("Recorded Assets") %></dt><dd data-plan-assets><%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Inventory Retail Value") %></dt><dd data-plan-retail><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Recorded Revenue") %></dt><dd data-plan-revenue><%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Recorded Cash Position") %></dt><dd data-plan-cash><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %></dd><dd class="report-kpi-note"><%= t("Cash balance derived from transactions recorded in LOKKA. This is not a bank-reconciled balance.") %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Known Inventory Units") %></dt><dd><span data-plan-units><%= asset.knownUnits %></span> <small><%= view.unitLabel %></small></dd></div>
</dl>
<dl class="report-status-grid">
<div><dt><%= t("Sales History") %></dt><dd><%= t(view.historyStatus) %></dd><% if (view.historyStatus === 'EARLY STAGE') { %><small><%= t("Recorded sales history is still limited and does not yet establish a reliable normal sales pattern.") %></small><% } else if (view.historyStatus === 'NO RECORDED SALES') { %><small><%= t("No completed sales have been recorded for this report period.") %></small><% } else { %><small><%= t("Documented sales history meets the current requirements for an annualized view. It does not guarantee future performance.") %></small><% } %><small><span data-plan-sales><%= accounting.saleCount %></span> <%= t("completed POS / Webstore sales") %></small></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Historical HPP Coverage") %></dt><dd><%= t(view.hppStatus) %></dd></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Financial Projection") %></dt><dd><%= t(view.projectionStatus) %></dd><% if (!plan.projection) { %><small><%= t("Sales history, historical costs and completeness evidence are not yet sufficient for a defensible 12-month projection.") %></small><% } %></div>
<div><dt><%= t("Inventory Value Opportunity") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd><small><%= t("Potential Gross Spread") %></small><small><%= t("Room for margin before operating and transaction costs. This is not net profit.") %></small></div>
</dl>

<% if (accounting.cogs === null) { %><p class="report-takeaway" data-hpp-limitation><%= t("Historical HPP is incomplete because some completed sales lack the cost recorded for each item at the time of sale, or lack item records. Historical gross and net profit cannot be stated reliably. The available cost subtotal is not the full cost of sales; see Appendix C.") %></p><% } %>
<% if (plan.legacySales > 0n) { %><p class="report-caption"><%= view.legacySalesExplanation %></p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-operations">
<p class="report-section-label"><%= t("02 / Business Position & Operating Plan") %></p><h3><%= t("Turn inventory readiness into consistent operations") %></h3>
<div class="report-position-grid">
<section class="report-block"><h4><%= t("Operations") %> <span class="report-state"><%= t("Operational Now") %></span></h4><ul><li><%= t("POS for active, eligible inventory") %></li><li><%= t("Inventory / HPP tracking") %></li><li><%= t("Finance ledger and Cash Flow") %></li><li><%= t("Basic accounting reports") %></li><li><%= t("Customer cart and unpaid order flow") %></li></ul></section>
<section class="report-block"><h4><%= t("Commercial Position") %></h4><ul><li><strong><%= view.productCount %></strong> <%= t("current catalog products") %></li><li><strong><%= asset.knownUnits %> <%= view.unitLabel %></strong> <%= t("known inventory") %></li><li><strong><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></strong> <%= t("potential inventory sales value") %></li></ul></section>
<section class="report-block"><h4><%= t("Data Completeness") %></h4><ul><li><strong><%= view.unknownStockProducts %></strong> <%= t("products require stock confirmation") %></li><li><strong><%= view.missingWeightProducts %></strong> <%= t("products have incomplete shipping weights") %></li><li><%= accounting.cogs === null ? t("Historical sale HPP coverage is incomplete") : accounting.saleCount === 0n ? t("No historical sales to assess HPP coverage") : t("Recorded historical sale HPP coverage is complete") %></li></ul></section>
</div>
<section class="report-block"><h3><%= t("12-Month Operating Plan") %></h3><p class="report-caption"><%= t("These phases describe intended business outcomes and indicative timing, not delivery promises or financial targets. Customer carts and unpaid orders already work; completed online checkout, payments and shipping integration remain planned.") %></p>
<ol class="report-roadmap">
<li><h4><%= t("0–3 months") %> — <%= t("Strengthen the sales foundation") %> <span class="report-state"><%= t("Planned") %></span></h4><ul><li><%= t("Complete stock confirmation and shipping weights") %></li><li><%= t("Complete product photographs and sales information") %></li><li><%= t("Make eligible products ready for consistent POS and Webstore selling") %></li></ul></li>
<li><h4><%= t("3–6 months") %> — <%= t("Complete the online purchase journey") %> <span class="report-state"><%= t("Planned") %></span></h4><ul><li><%= t("Develop completed Webstore checkout") %></li><li><%= t("Integrate payment and shipping providers") %></li><li><%= t("Extend customer order records and order tracking") %></li></ul></li>
<li><h4><%= t("6–9 months") %> — <%= t("Improve efficiency and repeat sales") %> <span class="report-state"><%= t("Planned") %></span></h4><ul><li><%= t("Increase repeat orders and evaluate sales channels") %></li><li><%= t("Review fast- and slow-selling products to improve stock decisions") %></li><li><%= t("Maintain consistent monthly reporting") %></li></ul></li>
<li><h4><%= t("9–12 months") %> — <%= t("Build a record of sustainable growth") %> <span class="report-state"><%= t("Planned") %></span></h4><ul><li><%= t("Scale suitable sales channels and optimize product mix") %></li><li><%= t("Strengthen repeat customer revenue") %></li><li><%= t("Build consistent revenue, margin and cash-flow history for investors") %></li></ul></li>
</ol></section>
</section>
<section class="report-primary-page" data-report-primary="plan-outlook">
<p class="report-section-label"><%= t("03 / Business Outlook") %></p><h3><%= t("Current Inventory Sales Capacity") %></h3>
<dl class="report-kpis report-kpis--three">
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Inventory Retail Value") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.retailValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Inventory at HPP") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %></dd></div>
<div class="report-kpi"><dt><%= t("Potential Gross Spread") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) %></dd></div>
</dl>
<p class="report-caption" data-inventory-opportunity><%= t("Recorded inventory has a retail value of {retail} and HPP value of {hpp}. The gross spread of {spread} indicates room for margin before operating and other transaction costs. The spread uses only inventory with confirmed stock and recorded cost.", { retail: formatIdr(asset.retailValue), hpp: formatIdr(asset.hppValue), spread: formatIdr(asset.grossSpread) }) %></p>
<p class="report-takeaway"><%= t("Potential Gross Spread is not guaranteed profit. It excludes operating expenses, discounts, unsold inventory risk, payment fees, shipping costs, returns and tax.") %></p>
<p class="report-caption"><%= t("The spread compares only inventory with confirmed stock and recorded cost. The retail value included in this comparison is") %> <%= formatIdr(asset.comparativeRetail) %><%= t(". Inventory retail value is not guaranteed revenue.") %></p>
<section class="report-block"><h3><%= t("12-Month Financial Projection") %></h3>
<% if (!plan.projection) { %><p class="report-projection-note" data-projection-unavailable><%= t("A 12-month financial projection is not shown yet because recorded operating history, historical costs and completeness evidence are not sufficient for a defensible projection.") %></p><% } else { const projection = plan.projection; %>
<p data-projection-available><%= t("Run-rate projection based on recorded historical performance, not a guaranteed forecast. Qualifying period:") %> <%= projection.from %> <%= t("to") %> <%= projection.to %>, <%= projection.months %> <%= t("complete months /") %> <%= projection.days %> <%= t("complete days.") %></p>
<dl class="report-facts"><div><dt><%= t("Revenue run rate") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.revenue) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("COGS run rate") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.cogs) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Gross profit run rate") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(projection.grossProfit) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Expense run rate") %></dt><dd><%= amount(projection.expenses) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Net profit run rate") %></dt><dd><%= amount(projection.netProfit) %></dd></div></dl>
<% if (projection.expenses === null || projection.netProfit === null) { %><p class="report-caption"><%= t("Expense and net run rates are not stated without confirmed expense coverage.") %></p><% } %>
<% } %><p><%= t("Evidence requirements and the existing run-rate method are retained in Appendix D.") %></p></section>
<nav class="report-appendix-index" aria-label="<%= t("Plan report appendices") %>"><h3><%= t("Supporting evidence") %></h3><a href="#plan-appendix-a"><%= t("Appendix A — Historical Performance Detail") %></a><a href="#plan-appendix-b"><%= t("Appendix B — Cash Flow Detail") %></a><a href="#plan-appendix-c"><%= t("Appendix C — Accounting and HPP Limitations") %></a><a href="#plan-appendix-d"><%= t("Appendix D — Projection Methodology") %></a><a href="#plan-appendix-e"><%= t("Appendix E — Risks and Assumptions") %></a></nav>
</section>
<div class="report-appendices">
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-a" data-report-wide data-report-appendix="A"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix A") %></p><h3><%= t("Historical Performance Detail") %></h3>
<p><%= t("Completed POS and Webstore sales from") %> <%= plan.period.fromInput %> <%= t("to the report date and time. Transaction dates use UTC. Manual income affects cash only and is not sales revenue.") %></p>
<p data-legacy-disclosure><%= view.legacySalesExplanation %> <%= t("Archiving products does not remove their historical transactions.") %></p>
<table class="report-summary-table"><caption><%= t("Recorded performance — unavailable profit measures are explained in Appendix C") %></caption><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Measure") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Recorded value") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Completed sales") %></th><td><%= accounting.saleCount %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Revenue") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(accounting.revenue) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Recorded item costs (partial subtotal)") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(accounting.knownCogs) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Total COGS") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= amount(accounting.cogs) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Gross profit") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= amount(accounting.grossProfit) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Operating expenses") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(accounting.operatingExpenses) %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><%= t("Net profit") %></th><td class="report-money"><%= amount(accounting.netProfit) %></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="report-detail-block"><h4><%= t("Contributing completed sales") %></h4><p class="report-caption"><%= t("Shows up to 100 recent completed sales. Summary figures cover all completed sales in the report period.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Historical completed sales") %>"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Reference") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Date (UTC)") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Source") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Revenue") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentSales) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.reference %></th><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><td><%= view.sourceLabels[row.source] ?? row.source %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.revenue) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div><% if (!accounting.recentSales.length) { %><p><%= t("No completed sales recorded in this period.") %></p><% } %></div>
<div class="report-detail-block"><h4><%= t("Historical sale-item costs") %></h4><p class="report-caption"><%= t("Shows up to 200 recent sold items. Costs are those recorded at the time of sale, rather than current product costs. Missing costs are shown as not available.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Historical sale item HPP") %>"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Reference / Product") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Variant / SKU") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Quantity") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("HPP / unit") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Line COGS") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentItems) { %><tr><th scope="row"><%= row.reference %><br /><%= row.product %></th><td><%= row.variant %><br /><%= row.sku %></td><td><%= row.quantity %></td><td class="report-money"><%= amount(row.unitCost) %></td><td class="report-money"><%= row.cogs === null ? t("Not available") : formatIdr(BigInt(row.cogs)) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="report-detail-block"><h4><%= t("Contributing operating expenses") %></h4><p class="report-caption"><%= t("Up to 100 most recent posted expenses. Voided entries are excluded from expense totals.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Historical operating expenses") %>"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Date (UTC)") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Reference") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Category") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Description") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Expense") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of accounting.recentExpenses) { %><tr><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><th scope="row"><%= row.id %></th><td><%= view.categoryLabels[row.category] ?? row.category %></td><td><%= row.notes ?? t("Manual expense") %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.total) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix report-appendix--new-page" id="plan-appendix-b" data-report-wide data-report-appendix="B"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix B") %></p><h3><%= t("Cash Flow Detail") %></h3>
<dl class="report-facts"><div><dt><%= t("Opening balance") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.openingBalance) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Recorded income") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.income) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Recorded expenses") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.expenses) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Net cash movement") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.net) %></dd></div><div><dt><%= t("Ending balance") %></dt><dd><%= formatIdr(plan.cash.endingBalance) %></dd></div></dl>
<p><%= t("Opening balance plus recorded income less expenses gives the ending balance. Voided entries are excluded. Cash Flow is not profit or a bank reconciliation.") %></p>
<div class="report-two-columns"><section class="report-block"><h4><%= t("Income by source") %></h4><ul><% for (const row of plan.cash.bySource) { %><li><%= view.sourceLabels[row.key] ?? row.key %>: <%= formatIdr(row.total) %></li><% } %></ul></section><section class="report-block"><h4><%= t("Expenses by category") %></h4><ul><% for (const row of plan.cash.byCategory) { %><li><%= view.categoryLabels[row.key] ?? row.key %>: <%= formatIdr(row.total) %></li><% } %></ul></section></div>
<p class="report-caption"><%= t("Up to 200 most recent ledger entries are shown from") %> <%= plan.cash.transactionCount %> <%= t("entries in the period, including void audit context. Totals use all qualifying posted movements.") %></p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="<%= t("Cash flow transaction detail") %>"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col"><%= t("Date (UTC)") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Reference") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Direction / Source") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Category / Notes") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Amount") %></th><th scope="col"><%= t("Status") %></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% for (const row of plan.cash.transactions) { %><tr><td><%= row.occurredAt.toISOString().replace('T',' ').slice(0,16) %></td><th scope="row"><%= row.transactionNumber ?? row.id %></th><td><%= t(row.direction) %> / <%= view.sourceLabels[row.source] ?? row.source %></td><td><%= view.categoryLabels[row.category] ?? row.category %><br /><%= view.transactionNotes(row) %><% if (row.voidReason) { %><br /><%= t("Void reason:") %> <%= row.voidReason %><% } %></td><td class="report-money"><%= formatIdr(row.amountRupiah) %></td><td><%= t(row.status) %></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-c" data-report-appendix="C"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix C") %></p><h3><%= t("Accounting and HPP Limitations") %></h3>
<p><%= accounting.missingItemCount %> <%= t("historical sale lines lack HPP;") %> <%= accounting.missingSaleCount %> <%= t("completed sales lack item records. Either gap prevents reliable total cost of sales, gross profit and net profit. The recorded item-cost subtotal covers only available costs; a zero subtotal does not mean all costs are zero.") %></p>
<p><%= t("Revenue includes completed POS and Webstore sales only. Manual income affects cash, not sales revenue. Historical profit uses costs recorded at the time of sale; current costs do not replace missing past costs. Operating expenses include recorded manual operating expenses, not opening balances, sale receipts or cancelled entries. Planned overhead is not automatically deducted from profit.") %></p>
<p><%= t("Current asset basis: inventory at HPP") %> <%= formatIdr(asset.hppValue) %> <%= t("plus active fixed acquisition value") %> <%= formatIdr(asset.fixedValue) %> <%= t("gives recorded assets of") %> <%= formatIdr(asset.combinedValue) %><%= t(". There are") %> <%= asset.incompleteCount %> <%= t("incomplete inventory items.") %></p>
<p><%= t("Inventory opportunity uses current recorded inventory; accounting profit uses historical sold-item cost snapshots. Incomplete quantity/cost rows are excluded from relevant inventory totals. Disposed assets are excluded from active fixed acquisition value. Fixed assets are not depreciated book values.") %></p>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-d" data-report-appendix="D"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix D") %></p><h3><%= t("Projection Methodology") %></h3>
<p><%= t("Projections will be presented only when sufficiently long and complete sales records can support a credible view of normal operations. Completed sales and historical item costs must be complete. Expense and net-profit projections also require adequate expense records. Until these conditions are met, withholding a projection avoids a misleading picture of growth.") %></p>
<p><%= t("Detailed eligibility: sales records must be documented as complete for consecutive calendar months immediately before the current UTC month, covering at least 30 complete days. Every completed sale must have item records and complete historical item costs. Time since the first sale alone is not evidence of reliable coverage.") %></p>
<p><%= t("Annualized amount = actual total for eligible months × 12 ÷ number of complete months, truncated toward zero to whole Rupiah. Expense and net-profit projections also require confirmed expense records for every included month. One-day or incomplete history is not annualized.") %></p>
<% if (plan.projection) { %><p><%= t("Current qualifying evidence:") %> <%= plan.projection.from %> <%= t("to") %> <%= plan.projection.to %>, <%= plan.projection.months %> <%= t("months /") %> <%= plan.projection.days %> <%= t("complete days. The outlook uses these same reported figures.") %></p><% } else { %><p><%= t("No qualifying projection is presented in this report instance.") %></p><% } %>
</section>
<section class="report-appendix" id="plan-appendix-e" data-report-appendix="E"><p class="report-section-label"><%= t("Appendix E") %></p><h3><%= t("Risks and Assumptions") %></h3><ul class="report-key-notes"><li><%= t("Historical profit cannot be assessed where historical item costs or sale details are incomplete. A partial cost subtotal must not be mistaken for total cost of sales.") %></li><li><%= t("Recorded sales history may be limited and includes the legacy transactions disclosed above. It should not be taken as an established normal sales pattern for the newly imported catalog.") %></li><li><%= t("Inventory retail value is not guaranteed revenue. Potential gross spread is not net profit: it excludes operating expenses, discounts, unsold inventory risk, payment and shipping fees, returns and tax.") %></li><li><%= t("No new financing amount, sales growth, future staffing, guaranteed revenue or profit is assumed.") %></li><li><%= t("The operating plan is indicative. Existing POS, inventory and financial records support current operations; completed Webstore checkout and payment and shipping integration are still planned.") %></li><li><%= t("Unknown stock and missing shipping weights require owner confirmation. Actual product photography must be supplied through the operational catalog flow.") %></li><li><%= t("This report covers recorded inventory and active fixed assets at acquisition cost, without depreciation. It is not a complete balance sheet or market valuation. No future sales growth, funding or profit is assumed without evidence.") %></li></ul>
</section>
</div></article>
